<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hant"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="186001"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="536115195"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="七里香"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="周杰伦"/><amll:meta key="album" value="七里香"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:57.200"><div begin="00:27.549" end="04:30.313"><p begin="00:27.549" end="00:33.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:27.549" end="00:28.088">窗</span><span begin="00:28.088" end="00:29.033">外</span><span begin="00:29.033" end="00:29.350">的</span><span begin="00:29.350" end="00:29.647">麻</span><span begin="00:29.647" end="00:30.419">雀</span><span begin="00:31.009" end="00:31.512">在</span><span begin="00:31.512" end="00:32.712">電線桿</span><span begin="00:32.712" end="00:33.023">上</span><span begin="00:33.023" end="00:33.291">多</span><span begin="00:33.291" end="00:33.956">嘴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">窗外的麻雀在电线杆上多嘴</span></p><p begin="00:34.387" end="00:40.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:34.387" end="00:34.832">妳</span><span begin="00:34.832" end="00:35.662">說</span><span begin="00:35.662" end="00:36.141">這</span><span begin="00:36.141" end="00:36.417">一</span><span begin="00:36.417" end="00:37.198">句</span><span begin="00:37.739" end="00:39.028">很有夏</span><span begin="00:39.028" end="00:39.464">天</span><span begin="00:39.464" end="00:39.720">的</span><span begin="00:39.720" end="00:40.150">感</span><span begin="00:40.150" end="00:40.779">覺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说这一句很有夏天的感觉</span></p><p begin="00:41.091" end="00:47.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:41.091" end="00:41.612">手</span><span begin="00:41.612" end="00:42.431">中</span><span begin="00:42.431" end="00:42.799">的</span><span begin="00:42.799" end="00:43.117">鉛</span><span begin="00:43.117" end="00:43.914">筆</span><span begin="00:44.469" end="00:45.829">在紙上</span><span begin="00:45.829" end="00:46.209">來</span><span begin="00:46.209" end="00:46.476">來</span><span begin="00:46.476" end="00:46.908">回</span><span begin="00:46.908" end="00:47.243">回</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">手中的铅笔在纸上来来回回</span></p><p begin="00:47.519" end="00:53.411" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:47.519" end="00:48.386">我用</span><span begin="00:48.386" end="00:48.866">幾</span><span begin="00:48.866" end="00:49.088">行</span><span begin="00:49.088" end="00:49.560">字</span><span begin="00:49.560" end="00:50.318">形容</span><span begin="00:50.318" end="00:50.841">妳</span><span begin="00:50.841" end="00:51.268">是</span><span begin="00:51.268" end="00:51.615">我</span><span begin="00:51.615" end="00:51.838">的</span><span begin="00:51.838" end="00:53.411">誰</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我用几行字形容你是我的谁</span></p><p begin="00:54.183" end="01:01.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:54.183" end="00:55.182">秋刀</span><span begin="00:55.182" end="00:56.012">魚</span><span begin="00:56.012" end="00:57.279">的滋味</span> <span begin="00:57.569" end="00:58.437">貓跟</span><span begin="00:58.437" end="00:59.303">妳</span><span begin="00:59.303" end="00:59.638">都</span><span begin="00:59.638" end="01:00.415">想了</span><span begin="01:00.415" end="01:01.022">解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">秋刀鱼的滋味 猫跟你都想了解</span></p><p begin="01:01.308" end="01:07.397" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:01.308" end="01:03.067">初戀的香</span><span begin="01:03.067" end="01:03.363">味</span><span begin="01:03.363" end="01:04.624">就這樣</span><span begin="01:04.624" end="01:05.419">被我</span><span begin="01:05.419" end="01:06.418">們</span><span begin="01:06.418" end="01:06.910">尋</span><span begin="01:06.910" end="01:07.397">回</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">初恋的香味就这样被我们寻回</span></p><p begin="01:07.739" end="01:14.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:07.739" end="01:08.193">那</span><span begin="01:08.193" end="01:08.563">溫</span><span begin="01:08.563" end="01:09.441">暖</span><span begin="01:09.441" end="01:13.753">的陽光像剛摘的鮮豔草</span><span begin="01:13.753" end="01:14.661">莓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那温暖的阳光像刚摘的鲜艳草莓</span></p><p begin="01:14.035" end="01:20.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:14.035" end="01:15.313">妳說妳</span><span begin="01:15.313" end="01:18.727">捨不得吃掉這一種</span><span begin="01:18.727" end="01:19.415">感</span><span begin="01:19.415" end="01:20.458">覺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你舍不得吃掉这一种感觉</span></p><p begin="01:20.761" end="01:27.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:20.761" end="01:21.181">雨</span><span begin="01:21.181" end="01:21.691">下</span><span begin="01:21.691" end="01:21.935">整</span><span begin="01:21.935" end="01:22.995">夜</span> <span begin="01:23.315" end="01:26.333">我的愛溢出就像</span><span begin="01:26.333" end="01:26.951">雨</span><span begin="01:26.951" end="01:27.356">水</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨下整夜 我的爱溢出就像雨水</span></p><p begin="01:27.494" end="01:34.149" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:27.494" end="01:28.025">院</span><span begin="01:28.025" end="01:28.418">子</span><span begin="01:28.418" end="01:28.671">落</span><span begin="01:28.671" end="01:29.586">葉</span> <span begin="01:30.048" end="01:33.045">跟我的思念厚厚</span><span begin="01:33.045" end="01:33.785">一</span><span begin="01:33.785" end="01:34.149">疊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">院子落叶 跟我的思念厚厚一叠</span></p><p begin="01:34.288" end="01:41.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:34.288" end="01:34.738">幾</span><span begin="01:34.738" end="01:35.104">句</span><span begin="01:35.104" end="01:35.382">是</span><span begin="01:35.382" end="01:36.424">非</span> <span begin="01:36.796" end="01:39.782">也無法將我的熱</span><span begin="01:39.782" end="01:40.241">情</span><span begin="01:40.241" end="01:40.465">冷</span><span begin="01:40.465" end="01:41.468">卻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">几句是非 也无法将我的热情冷却</span></p><p begin="01:41.902" end="01:47.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:41.902" end="01:44.873">妳出現在我詩的</span><span begin="01:44.873" end="01:45.350">每</span><span begin="01:45.350" end="01:45.539">一</span><span begin="01:45.539" end="01:47.494">頁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你出现在我诗的每一页</span></p><p begin="01:47.767" end="01:54.392" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:47.767" end="01:48.213">雨</span><span begin="01:48.213" end="01:48.679">下</span><span begin="01:48.679" end="01:48.924">整</span><span begin="01:48.924" end="01:49.972">夜</span> <span begin="01:50.364" end="01:53.314">我的愛溢出就像</span><span begin="01:53.314" end="01:53.983">雨</span><span begin="01:53.983" end="01:54.392">水</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨下整夜 我的爱溢出就像雨水</span></p><p begin="01:54.541" end="02:01.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:54.541" end="01:55.017">窗</span><span begin="01:55.017" end="01:55.489">台</span><span begin="01:55.489" end="01:55.707">蝴</span><span begin="01:55.707" end="01:56.696">蝶</span> <span begin="01:57.009" end="02:00.493">像詩裡紛飛的美麗</span><span begin="02:00.493" end="02:00.778">章</span><span begin="02:00.778" end="02:01.117">節</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">窗台蝴蝶 像诗里纷飞的美丽章节</span></p><p begin="02:01.288" end="02:08.605" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:01.288" end="02:01.749">我</span><span begin="02:01.749" end="02:02.194">接</span><span begin="02:02.194" end="02:02.377">著</span><span begin="02:02.377" end="02:03.454">寫</span> <span begin="02:03.863" end="02:06.788">把永遠愛妳寫進</span><span begin="02:06.788" end="02:07.266">詩</span><span begin="02:07.266" end="02:07.905">的結</span><span begin="02:07.905" end="02:08.605">尾</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我接着写 把永远爱你写进诗的结尾</span></p><p begin="02:08.879" end="02:14.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:08.879" end="02:11.922">妳是我唯一想要</span><span begin="02:11.922" end="02:12.374">的</span><span begin="02:12.374" end="02:12.574">了</span><span begin="02:12.574" end="02:14.888">解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我唯一想要的了解</span></p><p begin="02:41.806" end="02:48.329" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:41.806" end="02:42.245">雨</span><span begin="02:42.245" end="02:42.678">下</span><span begin="02:42.678" end="02:42.893">整</span><span begin="02:42.893" end="02:43.921">夜</span> <span begin="02:44.374" end="02:47.365">我的愛溢出就像</span><span begin="02:47.365" end="02:47.966">雨</span><span begin="02:47.966" end="02:48.329">水</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨下整夜 我的爱溢出就像雨水</span></p><p begin="02:48.560" end="02:55.115" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:48.560" end="02:49.042">院</span><span begin="02:49.042" end="02:49.456">子</span><span begin="02:49.456" end="02:49.748">落</span><span begin="02:49.748" end="02:50.735">葉</span> <span begin="02:51.095" end="02:54.102">跟我的思念厚厚</span><span begin="02:54.102" end="02:54.738">一</span><span begin="02:54.738" end="02:55.115">疊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">院子落叶 跟我的思念厚厚一叠</span></p><p begin="02:55.353" end="03:02.536" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:55.353" end="02:55.786">幾</span><span begin="02:55.786" end="02:56.155">句</span><span begin="02:56.155" end="02:56.440">是</span><span begin="02:56.440" end="02:57.364">非</span> <span begin="02:57.845" end="03:00.839">也無法將我的熱</span><span begin="03:00.839" end="03:01.222">情</span><span begin="03:01.222" end="03:01.475">冷</span><span begin="03:01.475" end="03:02.536">卻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">几句是非 也无法将我的热情冷却</span></p><p begin="03:02.930" end="03:08.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="03:02.930" end="03:04.633">妳出現在</span><span begin="03:04.633" end="03:05.488">我詩</span><span begin="03:05.488" end="03:05.859">的</span><span begin="03:05.859" end="03:06.352">每</span><span begin="03:06.352" end="03:06.619">一</span><span begin="03:06.619" end="03:08.578">頁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你出现在我诗的每一页</span></p><p begin="03:09.289" end="03:16.381" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="03:09.289" end="03:10.139">那飽</span><span begin="03:10.139" end="03:10.732">滿</span><span begin="03:10.954" end="03:12.381">的稻穗</span> <span begin="03:12.598" end="03:13.561">幸福</span><span begin="03:13.561" end="03:14.114">了</span><span begin="03:14.363" end="03:14.725">這</span><span begin="03:14.725" end="03:14.979">個</span><span begin="03:14.979" end="03:15.444">季</span><span begin="03:15.444" end="03:16.381">節</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那饱满的稻穗 幸福了这个季节</span></p><p begin="03:16.391" end="03:22.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="03:16.391" end="03:16.888">而</span><span begin="03:16.888" end="03:17.713">妳的</span><span begin="03:17.713" end="03:18.154">臉</span><span begin="03:18.154" end="03:18.340">頰</span><span begin="03:18.340" end="03:18.756">像</span><span begin="03:18.756" end="03:19.579">田裡</span><span begin="03:19.579" end="03:20.443">熟透</span><span begin="03:20.443" end="03:21.497">的</span><span begin="03:21.497" end="03:21.924">蕃</span><span begin="03:21.924" end="03:22.430">茄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你的脸颊像田里熟透的蕃茄</span></p><p begin="03:22.798" end="03:29.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="03:22.798" end="03:23.714">妳突</span><span begin="03:23.714" end="03:24.461">然</span><span begin="03:24.461" end="03:28.677">對我說 七里香的名字很</span><span begin="03:28.677" end="03:29.988">美</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你突然对我说 七里香的名字很美</span></p><p begin="03:29.104" end="03:35.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="03:29.104" end="03:30.353">我此刻</span><span begin="03:30.353" end="03:33.762">卻只想親吻妳倔強</span><span begin="03:33.762" end="03:34.449">的</span><span begin="03:34.449" end="03:35.506">嘴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我此刻却只想亲吻你倔强的嘴</span></p><p begin="03:35.827" end="03:42.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="03:35.827" end="03:36.284">雨</span><span begin="03:36.284" end="03:36.712">下</span><span begin="03:36.712" end="03:36.912">整</span><span begin="03:36.912" end="03:37.978">夜</span> <span begin="03:38.358" end="03:41.385">我的愛溢出就像</span><span begin="03:41.385" end="03:41.965">雨</span><span begin="03:41.965" end="03:42.372">水</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨下整夜 我的爱溢出就像雨水</span></p><p begin="03:42.566" end="03:49.165" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="03:42.566" end="03:43.059">院</span><span begin="03:43.059" end="03:43.450">子</span><span begin="03:43.450" end="03:43.708">落</span><span begin="03:43.708" end="03:44.693">葉</span> <span begin="03:45.074" end="03:48.114">跟我的思念厚厚</span><span begin="03:48.114" end="03:48.807">一</span><span begin="03:48.807" end="03:49.165">疊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">院子落叶 跟我的思念厚厚一叠</span></p><p begin="03:49.286" end="03:56.587" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="03:49.286" end="03:49.775">幾</span><span begin="03:49.775" end="03:50.154">句</span><span begin="03:50.154" end="03:50.439">是</span><span begin="03:50.439" end="03:51.486">非</span> <span begin="03:51.840" end="03:52.328">也</span><span begin="03:52.328" end="03:54.040">無法將我</span><span begin="03:54.040" end="03:54.822">的熱</span><span begin="03:54.822" end="03:55.310">情</span><span begin="03:55.310" end="03:55.541">冷</span><span begin="03:55.541" end="03:56.587">卻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">几句是非 也无法将我的热情冷却</span></p><p begin="03:56.927" end="04:02.534" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:56.927" end="03:59.900">妳出現在我詩的</span><span begin="03:59.900" end="04:00.375">每</span><span begin="04:00.375" end="04:00.576">一</span><span begin="04:00.576" end="04:02.534">頁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你出现在我诗的每一页</span></p><p begin="04:03.263" end="04:09.425" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="04:03.263" end="04:04.077">整</span><span begin="04:04.077" end="04:05.139">夜</span> <span begin="04:05.366" end="04:07.083">我的愛溢</span><span begin="04:07.083" end="04:08.316">出就像</span><span begin="04:08.316" end="04:08.980">雨</span><span begin="04:08.980" end="04:09.425">水</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整夜 我的爱溢出就像雨水</span></p><p begin="04:09.556" end="04:16.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="04:09.556" end="04:10.068">窗</span><span begin="04:10.068" end="04:10.457">台</span><span begin="04:10.457" end="04:10.710">蝴</span><span begin="04:10.710" end="04:11.835">蝶</span> <span begin="04:12.093" end="04:15.095">像詩裡紛飛的美</span><span begin="04:15.095" end="04:15.763">麗</span><span begin="04:15.763" end="04:16.147">章</span><span begin="04:16.147" end="04:16.930">節</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">窗台蝴蝶 像诗里纷飞的美丽章节</span></p><p begin="04:16.371" end="04:23.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="04:16.371" end="04:16.808">我</span><span begin="04:16.808" end="04:17.229">接</span><span begin="04:17.229" end="04:17.582">著</span><span begin="04:17.582" end="04:18.474">寫</span> <span begin="04:18.876" end="04:21.469">把永遠愛妳寫</span><span begin="04:21.469" end="04:22.260">進詩</span><span begin="04:22.260" end="04:22.497">的</span><span begin="04:22.497" end="04:22.959">結</span><span begin="04:22.959" end="04:23.561">尾</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我接着写 把永远爱你写进诗的结尾</span></p><p begin="04:23.940" end="04:30.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="04:23.940" end="04:24.321">妳</span><span begin="04:24.321" end="04:24.826">是</span><span begin="04:24.826" end="04:25.541">我唯</span><span begin="04:25.541" end="04:26.892">一想要</span><span begin="04:26.892" end="04:27.351">的</span><span begin="04:27.351" end="04:27.596">了</span><span begin="04:27.596" end="04:30.313">解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我唯一想要的了解</span></p></div></body></tt>